        <p><seg source="#source-62549-62597">申不害者。京人也。故鄭之賤臣。學</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-62597-62609">レ</note><seg source="#source-62609-62618">術以干</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-62618-62630">二</note><seg source="#source-62630-62636">韓昭</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-82-22" source="#source-62636-62722">矦</g><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-62722-62734">一</note><seg source="#source-62734-62740">。昭</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-82-22" source="#source-62740-62826">矦</g><seg source="#source-62826-62832">用爲</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-62832-62844">レ</note><seg source="#source-62844-62856">相。内修</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-62856-62868">二</note><seg source="#source-62868-62874">政教</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-62874-62886">一</note><seg source="#source-62886-62895">。外應</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-62895-62907">二</note><seg source="#source-62907-62910">諸</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-82-22" source="#source-62910-62996">矦</g><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-62996-63008">一</note><seg source="#source-63008-63026">。十五年。終</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-63026-63038">二</note><seg source="#source-63038-63050">申子之身</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-63050-63062">一</note><seg source="#source-63062-63083">。國治兵彊。無</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-63083-63095">二</note><seg source="#source-63095-63098">侵</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-63098-63110">レ</note><seg source="#source-63110-63116">韓者</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" 